        "installation": "<p><strong>Via WordPress Dashboard</strong><br />\n1. Go to Plugins &gt; Add New<br />\n2. Search “BWD Elementor Addons”<br />\n3. Install and activate</p>\n<p><strong>Manual Upload</strong><br />\n1. Download plugin from WordPress.org<br />\n2. Go to Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin<br />\n3. Choose file, click &#8220;Install Now&#8221;, then Activate</p>\n<p>After activation, open the builder editor and search for &#8220;BWD&#8221; in the widget panel.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20this%20plugin%20without%20elementor%3F'>\nCan I use this plugin without Elementor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, It must be installed and activated.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='will%20it%20work%20with%20other%20elementor%20addon%20plugins%3F'>\nWill it work with other Elementor Addon plugins?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='will%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F'>\nWill it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='if%20i%20upgrade%20to%20premium%2C%20will%20my%20content%20be%20lost%3F'>\nIf I upgrade to Premium, will my content be lost?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, your existing content will remain intact.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20support%20elementor%20pro%3F'>\nDoes it support Elementor Pro?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
